<title>UK: Premier Oil buys into Pakistan oil field.</title>
<headline>Premier Oil buys into Pakistan oil field.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Premier Oil Plc said on Wednesday that its overseas unit had agreed to buy the remaining shares in Idemitsu Pakistan Oil Exploraiton Company Ltd.</p>
<p>Premier will pay $33 million for a 15.79 percent stake in the the firm's sole asset - the Kadanwari gasfield. The payment will be financed from existing facilities.</p>
<p>The deal will take Premier's Pakistan production to more than 5,000 barrels of oil equivalent per day.</p>
<p>--London newsroom +44 171 5427717</p>
</text>
